              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu ŵa yilambo yosope ŵaliji mkwika ku Iguputo kuti asume yakulya kwa Yosefe, pakuŵa sala jajenele cilambo cosope capasi.",
          "type": "text",
